    },
    {
      "id": "94:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:23079:23081"
    },
    {
      "id": "94:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你走到小厨房。幸好冰箱和炉子都是烧燃气的。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:23081:23104"
    },
    {
      "id": "94:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你给自己做了一顿饭，在小餐桌上开始享用。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:23104:23126"
    },
    {
      "id": "94:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "在记录表上勾选 吃饱。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:23126:23139"
    },
    {
      "id": "94:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果记录表上的 求生专家 已被勾选，你的肚子开始翻腾，必须转到 102。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:23139:23177"
    },
    {
      "id": "94:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要好好品尝食物，转到 106。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:23177:23194"
    },
    {
      "id": "94:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要戳着食物为自己的状况担心，转到 107。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:23194:23217"
    }
  ]
}
